# Dineros.cc — Overview

Dineros.cc is a Nuxt 4 + TypeScript application for predictive budgeting, real-time spending optimization, and simplified accounting. It combines a feature-rich web app, a modular server (Nitro/H3) with a large API surface, a robust financial forecast engine, queues/cron for background work, and a companion microservice used for operational tasks (e.g., DB key rotation/migrate).

## Purpose

- Predictive budgeting and forecasting across multiple account types
- Register management with transfers, reconciliations, and PLAID syncing
- Bills, notifications, categories, savings goals, and reporting
- Security-first approach with field-level encryption and 2FA

## Tech stack

- Frontend: Nuxt 4 (Vue 3), Tailwind CSS, Pinia
- Backend: Nitro/H3 API routes (in Nuxt server), BullMQ (queues), Redis (cache/queues), Prisma ORM (MySQL 8)
- Data and integrations: Plaid, Postmark, OpenAI
- Tooling: TypeScript, Vitest, Playwright, ESLint, PNPM workspaces
- Infra: Dockerfiles, GKE manifests/templates, GitHub Actions CI/CD

## Audience

- Contributors working on full-stack TypeScript/Nuxt
- Backend/service engineers working on API endpoints, background jobs, and the forecast engine
- DevOps engineers managing CI/CD and GKE deployments

## Where to start

- README.md for setup, commands, and architecture sketch
